      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's completely natural to feel out of place when the sense of being 'essential' fades. But we are more than just the roles we've played; we are complex beings with memories, joy, relaxation, and peace matters too. Just as much as during your mission, can this be a new chapter where you can discover or rediscover parts of yourself you may not appreciate yet? What aspects of life did make life worth living for you during those 30 years? Perhaps revisiting those elements could spark something new.",
      "source": "target",
